msgid ""
msgstr ""
"# Architecture Design and Core Features\n"
"\n"
"## 1. System Architecture Overview\n"
"\n"
"This system adopts a **front-end and back-end separation** architecture, with the overall structure divided into three layers: **presentation layer**, **business logic layer**, and **data access layer**. The front-end uses the Vue.js framework, the back-end uses the Spring Boot framework, and the database uses MySQL. The system communicates via RESTful API.\n"
"\n"
"## 2. Core Feature Modules\n"
"\n"
"### 2.1 User Management Module\n"
"- User registration and login (supports JWT token authentication)\n"
"- Role-based access control (RBAC)\n"
"- User profile management and password modification\n"
"\n"
"### 2.2 Data Processing Module\n"
"- Batch data import and export (supports Excel and CSV formats)\n"
"- Data validation and cleaning\n"
"- Real-time data synchronization\n"
"\n"
"### 2.3 Report Generation Module\n"
"- Custom report templates\n"
"- Automated report generation and scheduled delivery\n"
"- Multi-dimensional data visualization charts\n"
"\n"
"## 3. Key Technical Implementation\n"
"\n"
"### 3.1 Front-end Technology Stack\n"
"- Vue.js 3 + Element Plus component library\n"
"- Vuex for state management\n"
"- Axios for HTTP request handling\n"
"\n"
"### 3.2 Back-end Technology Stack\n"
"- Spring Boot 2.7 + MyBatis Plus\n"
"- Redis for caching\n"
"- RabbitMQ for message queue processing\n"
"\n"
"## 4. Security Design\n"
"\n"
"- HTTPS encrypted transmission\n"
"- SQL injection and XSS attack prevention\n"
"- Operation logging and audit trails\n"

msgid "架构设计与核心特性"
msgstr "Architecture Design and Core Features"

msgid "1.逻辑架构"
msgstr "1\\. Logical Architecture"

msgid "![图像](./figures/architectural_diagram.png) **Triton-Ascend 架构说明**"
msgstr "![Image](./figures/architectural_diagram.png) **Triton-Ascend Architecture Description**"

msgid "图像"
msgstr "image"

msgid ".. image:: ./figures/architectural_diagram.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ./figures/architectural_diagram.png"

msgid "**核心组件：**"
msgstr "**Core Components:**"

msgid "**`Ascend language extension`**：适配 Ascend 的 Triton 语言扩展"
msgstr "**`Ascend language extension`**: Triton language extension adapted for Ascend."

msgid "**`compiler`**：适配 Ascend 的 Triton 编译器"
msgstr "**`compiler`**: A Triton compiler adapted for Ascend."

msgid "**`driver`**：适配 Ascend 的设备驱动接口"
msgstr "**`driver`**: Device driver interface adapted for Ascend."

msgid "**组件功能：**"
msgstr "**Component Function:**"

msgid "**`Ascend language extension`** 在标准 Triton 语言基础上，引入针对 Ascend NPU 架构的语法与语义扩展。"
msgstr "**`Ascend language extension`** introduces syntax and semantic extensions tailored for the Ascend NPU architecture, building upon the standard Triton language."

msgid "**`compiler`** 接收来自上层 Triton compiler 生成的中间表示文件 `TTIR`（Triton IR），执行一系列适配昇腾硬件的转换。"
msgstr "**`compiler`** receives the intermediate representation file `TTIR` (Triton IR) generated by the upper-level Triton compiler and performs a series of transformations to adapt to Ascend hardware."

msgid "Triton IR → Linalg IR → AscendNPU IR → triton_xxx_kernel.o\\n"
msgstr "Triton IR → Linalg IR → AscendNPU IR → triton_xxx_kernel.o"

msgid "Triton IR 转换为 Linalg IR，再经 BiSheng Compiler 生成面向 Ascend NPU 的可执行二进制文件  `triton_xxx_kernel.o`。"
msgstr "Triton IR is converted to Linalg IR, and then through BiSheng Compiler, an executable binary file `triton_xxx_kernel.o` targeting Ascend NPU is generated."

msgid "**`driver`** 提供 Triton 运行时与 Ascend 软件栈（CANN）之间的对接能力， 加载由 BiSheng Compiler 生成的设备侧可执行内核 `triton_xxx_kernel.o` 。"
msgstr "**`driver`** provides the interface capability between the Triton runtime and the Ascend software stack (CANN), loading the device-side executable kernel `triton_xxx_kernel.o` generated by the BiSheng Compiler."

msgid "2.代码结构"
msgstr "2\\. Code Structure"

msgid "2.1 代码结构原则"
msgstr "2.1 Code Structure Principles"

msgid "本项目在标准 Triton 基础上，扩展支持华为 Ascend NPU（通过 CANN 软件栈）。整体设计遵循以下**代码原则**："
msgstr "This project extends standard Triton to support Huawei Ascend NPU (via the CANN software stack). The overall design follows the following **code principles**:"

msgid "**若修改与目标硬件无关**（target independent），应保留在 **Triton core** 部分（如language、runtime的通用修改）；"
msgstr "**If the modification is target independent**, it should be kept in the **Triton core** section (e.g., general modifications to language, runtime)."

msgid "**若修改与 Ascend 硬件强相关**（target affinitive），应放在 **Triton-Ascend** 中。"
msgstr "**If the modification is strongly related to Ascend hardware** (target affinitive), it should be placed in **Triton-Ascend**."

msgid "2.2 目录结构与功能说明"
msgstr "2.2 Directory Structure and Functional Description"

msgid "目录或文件"
